The '''Wizard Tower''' is a sub-location of the [[Hub Island]].

{{ZoneText|Talk to the Wizard.|Use the Wizard Portal}}

== Features ==
The '''Wizard Tower''' features a few attractions.

=== Wizard Portal ===
Located in the center of the seventh and final floor of the '''Wizard Tower''' is the Wizard Portal. Entering the portal will immediately teleport the player next to it, prompting dialogue from the [[Wizard]]. 

Once the player is {{SkyBlock Level|12}} or higher, they can talk to the [[Wizard]] to grant exclusive dialogue. Once it has been completed, the player can purchase access to the [[Rift Dimension]] for a limited amount of time. Accessing the Portal once the player has purchased access will teleport the player to the {{zone|Wizard Tower (Rift)}}  in the [[Rift Dimension]].

