== Trivia ==
*Casting a [[Fishing Rod]] into the [[#Wizard Portal|Wizard Portal]] before the [[Rift Dimension]] was released would result in the following message: {{mctxt|c|size=11|Sorry, no update here :(}}
*If you don't have a Dimensional Infusion purchased, the text above the Wizard Portal reads {{rmt|&bTravel to: &d&kL&r&d&ki&r&d&km&r&d&kb&r&d&ko}} ("Travel to: Limbo") rather than {{rmt|&bTravel to: &dThe Rift}}.
*There are leftover {{Item|Yellow Wool}} and {{Item|Block of Lapis Lazuli|text=Lapis Lazuli}} blocks hidden within the tower's roof and underneath the tower (see [[#Gallery|Gallery]]). They, however, cannot be seen without using 3rd-party tools.

